    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/9/49919.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 85,
    "turn_text": "I think it would be business as usual, and you should know that I have been very careful over my long career on these issues that take back almost to the Bobby Sand's death to always make sure that this was bipartisan. So during my time as chairman and co-chairman, I carefully recruited Republican members of Congress who were interested in the issue, and we have a strong bipartisan committee.",
